      "description": "Selected icon-over-label tile on the persistent plum rail.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\" aria-label=\"CareSync\"><button class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 10 9-7 9 7v10H15v-7H9v7H3Z\"/></svg><span>Home</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{width:72px;background:var(--plum,#342449);padding:8px}.ds-nav{font-family:\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;width:100%;min-height:70px;padding:13px 2px;border:0;border-radius:10px;font-size:.6875rem;color:#ece6f5;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--nav-hover,#4b395f)}.ds-nav[aria-current=page]{color:var(--plum,#342449);background:var(--nav-selected,#e8ddf5)}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#9575bb);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-nav svg{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none;width:25px;height:25px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Suggested Question",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "suggestion",
      "description": "A compact shortcut into a caregiver question.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-suggestion\">Get me ready for the visit</button>",
      "css": ".ds-suggestion{font-family:\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--chip-bg,#f8f5fc);border:1px solid var(--chip-border,#dbd1e7);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 11px;color:var(--chip-text,#5b3e73);font-size:.75rem;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease}.ds-suggestion:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--chip-hover,#e6dcf1)}.ds-suggestion:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#9575bb);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-suggestion:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-suggestion{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Care Status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status",
      "description": "Compact status with a label and supporting icon; color remains secondary to text.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg>Upcoming</span><span class=\"ds-status ds-status-taken\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4L19 6\"/></svg>Taken</span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{font-family:\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:20px;font-size:.6875rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--status-text,#59506d);background:var(--status-bg,#eeedf4);text-transform:capitalize}.ds-status-taken{color:var(--green,#24684e);background:var(--green-bg,#e5f1eb)}.ds-status svg{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none;width:13px;height:13px;stroke-width:2}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Care Summary",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "summary",
      "description": "White summary row pairing an icon with care context and a next-step chevron.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-summary\"><button class=\"ds-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 4-5 5a6.4 6.4 0 0 0 9 9l5-5a6.4 6.4 0 0 0-9-9Z\"/><path d=\"m7 7 10 10\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-copy\"><strong>Medication check-in</strong><span>Review the medication record</span></span><svg class=\"ds-chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-summary{max-width:680px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--white,#fff);border-radius:12px}.ds-row{font-family:\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;width:100%;padding:15px 19px;border:0;text-align:left;background:white;color:var(--ink,#20192e);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease}.ds-row:hover{background:#f9f7fc}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#9575bb);outline-offset:4px;outline-offset:-4px}.ds-row svg{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none;width:23px;height:23px}.ds-copy{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-copy strong{display:block;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600}.ds-copy>span{display:block;font-size:.8125rem;line-height:1.5;margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted,#665c7d)}.ds-row .ds-chevron{width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--muted,#665c7d)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-row{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Confirmation Slip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "confirmation",
      "description": "An outlined proposal with explicit confirm/defer actions and textual pending state.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-confirm\"><h3>Send a medication reminder?</h3><p>This sends a reminder. It does not mark the dose as taken.</p><div class=\"ds-actions\"><button class=\"ds-confirm-yes\">Yes, send it</button><button class=\"ds-confirm-no\">Not now</button></div><div class=\"ds-pending\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg>Awaiting your confirmation</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-confirm{font-family:\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--confirmation-border,#8253a6);border-radius:12px;padding:19px;background:var(--white,#fff);color:var(--ink,#20192e)}.ds-confirm h3{font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 6px}.ds-confirm p{font-size:.8125rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted,#665c7d);margin:0}.ds-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:17px}.ds-actions button{font-family:\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;min-height:42px;padding:10px 17px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease,border-color 160ms ease;}.ds-confirm-yes{color:white;background:var(--action,#512779);border:1px solid var(--action,#512779)}.ds-confirm-yes:hover{background:var(--action-hover,#3e1c60)}.ds-confirm-no{color:var(--action,#512779);background:white;border:1px solid var(--secondary-border,#b9a7ce)}.ds-confirm-no:hover{background:var(--lavender,#eee9f6)}.ds-actions button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#9575bb);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-pending{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--action,#512779);margin-top:9px}.ds-pending svg{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none;width:16px;height:16px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-actions button{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Assistant Message",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "assistant-message",
      "description": "A white directional message surface with linked-ring authorship.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-message\"><span class=\"ds-assistant\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\"><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"11\"/><circle cx=\"25\" cy=\"25\" r=\"11\"/></svg></span><div class=\"ds-message-content\"><p class=\"ds-author\">CareSync</p><div class=\"ds-bubble\"><p>What would you like to check in the care record?</p></div><time class=\"ds-time\">11:48 AM</time></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-message{font-family:\"Segoe UI Variable\",\"Segoe UI\",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;gap:15px;color:var(--ink,#20192e)}.ds-assistant{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;color:white;background:var(--action,#512779);margin-top:24px}.ds-assistant svg{width:24px;height:24px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex:none;width:28px;height:28px;stroke-width:2.6}.ds-message-content{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-author{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:650;color:var(--action,#512779);margin:0 0 7px}.ds-bubble{background:var(--white,#fff);padding:14px 18px;border-radius:0 12px 12px;max-width:74ch}.ds-bubble p{font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.65;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-line}.ds-time{display:block;font-size:.6875rem;color:var(--muted,#665c7d);margin-top:6px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Community health wayfinding",
    "overview": "CareSync is a calm, conversational family care workspace. Deep plum establishes a stable navigation landmark; cool white care context and a pale lavender conversation field make household information easy to locate without competing with the current task.\n\nThe visual language is practical and approachable: readable Segoe-like task typography, precise line icons, linked-ring identity, white message surfaces, and outlined confirmation slips. Care status remains explicit in text and small semantic badges. Simulation labels and confirmation language are part of the interface's clarity.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Plum landmarks and lavender conversation surfaces.",
      "Readable task typography with restrained size contrast.",
      "Flat tonal layering, thin dividers, and softly rounded controls.",
      "Clearly authored messages and explicit action confirmation."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Text-With-Status Rule",
        "body": "Communicate state with a readable label alongside its color; use an icon where the implemented status pattern supplies one.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tonal Depth Rule",
        "body": "Preserve tonal separation and thin borders instead of introducing decorative drop shadows.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use plum landmarks, lavender conversation surfaces, and white foreground content.",
      "Do keep care status legible in text alongside semantic color.",
      "Do retain the linked-ring identity and precise rounded line icons.",
      "Do keep confirmation decisions and their eventual outcomes visible in the conversation.",
      "Do preserve the accessible context drawer and reduced-motion behavior."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add decorative shadows to the flat tonal surface system.",
      "Don't substitute a display or editorial font for the approved Segoe-like task typography.",
      "Don't use color alone to communicate medication or action state.",
      "Don't visually present a delivered reminder as a taken medication."
    ]
  }
}
